  "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The correct answer is <math alttext=\"StartFraction 11 Over 4 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>. It&rsquo;s given that the function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math> is defined by <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 5 left parenthesis one fourth minus x right parenthesis squared plus StartFraction 11 Over 4 EndFraction\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"one fourth\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math> for <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> in this equation yields <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis one fourth right parenthesis equals 5 left parenthesis one fourth minus one fourth right parenthesis squared plus StartFraction 11 Over 4 EndFraction\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>, which is equivalent <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis one fourth right parenthesis equals 5 left parenthesis 0 right parenthesis squared plus StartFraction 11 Over 4 EndFraction\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>, or <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis one fourth right parenthesis equals StartFraction 11 Over 4 EndFraction\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>. Therefore, the value of <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis one fourth right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math> is <math alttext=\"StartFraction 11 Over 4 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>. Note that 11/4 or 2.75 are examples of ways to enter a correct answer.</p>",
